    "body": "## Mutation Testing Results\n\n- ✅ Caught: 678\n- ❌ Missed: 262\n\n### Top 10 Missed Mutations\n\n```\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut00/mod.rs:806:9: replace PaymentMethod::is_onchain -> bool with true\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut00/mod.rs:806:9: replace PaymentMethod::is_onchain -> bool with false\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut04.rs:111:64: replace match guard *description with true in <impl Serialize for MintMethodSettings>::serialize\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut04.rs:117:28: replace += with -= in <impl Serialize for MintMethodSettings>::serialize\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut04.rs:117:28: replace += with *= in <impl Serialize for MintMethodSettings>::serialize\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut04.rs:159:9: replace <impl Visitor<'de> for MintMethodSettingsVisitor>::expecting -> fmt::Result with Ok(Default::default())\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut04.rs:310:50: replace && with || in Settings::get_settings\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut04.rs:324:9: replace Settings::remove_settings -> Option<MintMethodSettings> with None\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut04.rs:326:61: replace && with || in Settings::remove_settings\ncrates/cashu/src/nuts/nut04.rs:326:51: replace == with != in Settings::remove_settings\n```\n\n### Action Items\n\n1. Review the missed mutations above\n2. Add tests to catch these mutations\n3. For the complete list, check the [mutants.out artifact](https://github.com/cashubtc/cdk/actions/runs/26623107896)\n\n**cargo-mutants version:** cargo-mutants 27.0.0\n\n---\n\n💡 **Tip:** Use `just mutants-quick` to test only your changes before pushing!",
